WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:05.980
Never-Ending
Summer Break

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:05.980
Next time: "Never-Ending Summer Break"

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.860
Something's not right.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.240
Somehow or another,
I just get that feeling.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.080
Kyon-kun, phone.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.660
You don't have to tell me.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.790
Suzumiya Haruhi

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.790
What does she want?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.170
<i>Kyon! You're free today, right?</i>

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.670
<i>We're meeting at the café at
exactly two o'clock! Over!</i>

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.260
You didn't even let me
get a single word in. Over.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:40.260
What?

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.640
<i>I forgot to mention,
make sure you bring a swimsuit!</i>

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.560
There's still plenty of summer break left.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:52.320
My homework... can wait till later.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.790
Come on in!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:33.380
Never-Ending
Summer Break

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.330
Well now, well now.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.680
It's huge...

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:36.300
When it comes to summer,
there's nothing like going to the pool!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.010
We're gonna go all out and
enjoy our day to the fullest!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:44.260
Haruhi. I've heard you say that line so many times this summer, my ears are growing calluses.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.180
In fact, my calluses are growing
little calluses of their own, and then–

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:49.240
Hi-ya!

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.260
Callous!

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.730
Kyon-kun. Diving's against the rules, y'know?

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.530
Wait, you saw that, didn't you?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:58.860
I was pushed!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:02:59.900
Jeez!

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.740
Before you go in the pool,
you need to do your warm-up exercises!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:09.080
Why is it that you keep showing
up at events with swim suits?

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.210
And now, we're gonna have
an obstacle course race!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.880
For the person who's first
to reach the goal, we have:

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:21.380
All you can eat of this lovely array of fruits!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.390
Dorian! Muskmelon! Mangosteen!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.890
You and Mikuru'll have a feast!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.350
Melon! Muskmelon! Melon!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.560
Such high-class fruits!
How much did they cost?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.650
They look delicious!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.360
Here we go!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.650
Ready...

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.400
Start!!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.570
You're doing it too!?

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.330
Aaah! I can't keep going!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.670
Kyon-kun, waaiit!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.090
Sorry, but right now,
even over my own sister,

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.470
the melons take precedence!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.720
You won't beat me!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.350
Nooo!!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:15.860
<i>Adios!</i>

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.610
Asakura-san!!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:26.170
Oh-ho! Looks like Haru-nyan
and Kyon-kun are fightin' for first!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.740
Do your best!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.080
Yes, Muskmelon-san!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.450
For you, Asahina-san, I'd–

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.040
My glasses, my glasses, my glasses, my glasses!

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.590
Nagato!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.550
Damn it!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.180
My comrades!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:50.010
Nevertheless, I have no
choice but keep going on!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.470
Tranza!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.880
Agh! Muskmelon!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.600
What a fool.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.200
Kyon-kun, what took you so long?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.110
And in the end, you're all sharing it!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.080
Muskmelons... Where have you gone?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.410
Hey... Are you okay?

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:15.540
Yeah.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.120
Huh?

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.630
Oh, thank y–

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.880
Gah, it's you!?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.920
They're very <i>delicious</i>.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.800
There are cherries, too.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:26.220
See?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.260
Don't "rero rero" me!!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:28.760
Be my guest.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.520
IT'S GOOD!

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:41.440
Hey.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.230
Hmm?

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.030
Have you... started on your homework yet?

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:46.950
Not yet.

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.200
Oh, okay.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.700
Well, I'm sure it'll work out.

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:54.620
See ya.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.370
Yeah.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:05:59.920
All right, everyone!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.340
It just so happens there's a
Bon Festival dance tonight!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.510
We'll have to go check it out, right?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.550
But of course!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.890
Once you've got your yukatas on,
we'll meet in front of the station.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.920
Hey, Haruhi... I–

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.010
Alright! We'll meet up this evening!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.610
This is hard!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.320
Mikuru-chan, your hips!
Put your hips into it!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.820
Seeing Asahina-san in a
yukata is the greatest!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.330
Wait, this is no time
for me to be living it up!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.330
My homework...

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.840
What!? Now you got
us part-time jobs!?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.470
Nice work!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:56.100
Ah, once you're done with that,
go set out the merchandise.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.730
You're just eating ice cream!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.520
Hey...

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.560
Hmm?

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.980
You done with
your homework?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:06.110
Not yet.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.690
Ah, okay.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.030
This is getting out of hand!...

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.370
Haruhi!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.330
Today, I–

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.870
Will be going stargazing!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.580
In that case, lemme
handle the telescope.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.000
That's our Tsuruya-san!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.420
You sure are quick on the uptake!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.460
The weather is quite nice today,

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.000
so I'm sure we'll get a
lovely view of the stars.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.210
Now then!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.050
Let's take this opportunity
to discover some Martians!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:32.130
C'mon, Mikuru-chan,
help me out!

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.890
Eh?... Martians... Martians... Martians!...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.890
I better discover some time to do my homework.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.810
We're going fishing today!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.560
Hey, Haruhi...

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.690
What's up?

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.320
Kyon, don't tell me you're secretly
planning to eat the fish we catch.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.320
You must take your fish, and then!:

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.190
Catch and release.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.200
Coexistence with Nature...
How admirable.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.490
You can't help but feel
sorry for them, you know?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.620
H-home-... homewo-...

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:06.170
Homewo-... Homework-...
Home-... work-...

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.710
Today we're going on a movie marathon!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.210
There's not much time!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.220
C'mon, everyone, hurry up!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.890
C'mon, fast pace to the next one!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.850
Asakura-san, are you okay?

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.140
Hey, Nagato.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.150
Mmm?

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.690
Have you finished your homework?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.610
No, not yet.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:33.900
I think I'm gonna be in trouble
if I don't start on it soon...

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.410
Yeah, probably.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:38.870
Tomorrow, I'm gonna stand up
to Haruhi and boldly declare:

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.430
"Today is the day we do homework!"

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.160
Hmm!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.420
Hey, Haruhi.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.090
Today is–

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.090
Time to get pumped up!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.130
Kyon! Stop lazing around!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.470
But, I like lazing around.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.390
We're going to karaoke!!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.680
We'll drink it all down

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.810
Glaring Glaring Shake! Yay!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:06.810
Yaay!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:07.940
Don't "Yay!" me!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:10.860
Hey, Kyon.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:14.400
You've got one hell
of a long face today.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.390
Look here, Haruhi...

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.700
We're going bird-watching today!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.280
Isn't that exciting?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:23.790
Fine... Just do what you want with me!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.920
Ah, nature's just so beautiful!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.540
Yes, very much so.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.760
Hey, Nagato.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:36.880
Hmm?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.430
Did you finish your homework?

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.100
Not yet.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.430
There's only two days
of summer break left.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.390
What am I gonna do!?

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:50.690
HOMEWORK!!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.920
By the way, Kyon-kun.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.620
Since summer break's almost over now,
did you remember to do your homework?

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.920
Homework? Don't be silly, Ryōko.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.000
Homework's something
you get finished back in July!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.550
Well, I did mine on a schedule,

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.380
so it took me until
the beginning of August.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:19.510
Hmmm.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:23.010
Anyway, seems like we've finished
every last thing on the list.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.220
Hmmmm.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.230
I wonder if this was good enough...

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.140
But... Yeah, I guess that should do it.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:36.190
Hey, does anyone have
anything else they wanted to do?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.150
Okay then.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.620
We did all kinds of stuff this summer,

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.200
so I guess we can just call it for today.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.120
I left tomorrow open just in case,

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:48.460
so you can go ahead
and use that time to rest.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.250
See you in two days, in the club room.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.980
I'm not done with <i>my</i> homework yet!!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.480
Huh!?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.990
That's right! I... haven't even started on it.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.240
What are you talking about?

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:25.240
When <i>could</i> I have done it,
with us playing around all day every day!?

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.040
Hold on, Kyon-kun.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.790
If you're trying to make
a joke, it's not funny.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.830
If you want to talk nonsense,
save it for when you're asleep!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.670
He <i>was</i> actually saying it
when he was asleep.

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.260
No. This isn't a joke,
and I'm not sleep-talking.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:42.220
Actually, I'm more surprised that
you guys are all already done!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.890
Oh, you're one to talk!
Suddenly getting all serious!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.850
Hold on, everyone.
Let's all try to calm down.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.350
Koizumi-kun, you can shut it.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.350
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.640
Nagato. Asakura.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:53.650
I have a favor to ask you.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.190
Huh?

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.860
Let me copy your homework!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.480
Ah! Um...

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:03.490
Jeez. You can't copy ours,
but we'll help you with yours.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.200
Okay! Then, if it's fine with you,
we can go to my house and–

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.290
Hold it right there.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:08.990
Huh?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.410
If that's how it is, then...

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.000
I'm coming too!!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.130
Okay, okay, everyone.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.380
We'll put an end to
your homework today,

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:28.720
and then, go on to face the new semester with clean and healthy bodies!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.220
Yeah!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.020
Yeah.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.900
Oh? Is something wrong?

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.810
You guys...

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:42.690
You were perfectly happy to let everyone think I was
the only one not finished with their homework,

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.150
but neither of you are done either!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:49.280
My plan all along was to <i>finish</i> today.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.750
But, when it was decided that we would go to
your house to do homework, I thought,

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:57.000
"Well then, perhaps we could <i>finish</i> together."

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:02.670
And above all else, since Suzumiya-san came
along as well, my intention to <i>finish</i> here is–

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.920
<i>Shut up</i>. No more from you.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.800
I'm kind of really good at last-minute cramming,

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.850
so I thought it'd probably be
okay to leave it till the last day.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:11.930
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.020
So I'm the only one who's
totally screwed without help.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.480
There's still hope.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.150
L-let's work hard together?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.900
Nagato-san and Koizumi-kun
should probably be fine,

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:27.160
but Kyon-kun, if there's anything you
don't understand, just ask Asakura-sensei.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:29.700
What?

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:31.660
It's kind of late to ask, but...

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.910
Asakura, that outfit...

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.210
Really helps you get
motivated, doesn't it?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.290
I truly appreciate your consideration!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:41.960
And then,

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:46.010
there's no possible reason <i>this</i> one would have
come except to make a nuisance of herself.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.840
Hey, do you have the next one of this?

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.720
Huh?

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.720
No, that's the latest release.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.180
Really?

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.480
I was really curious about what
happens next, but I guess that's out.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:13:59.560
H-hey!...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.980
Maybe I can find something interesting!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.570
Don't mess things up too much!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.990
How rude! I won't
mess your stuff up.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.900
Not <i>too</i> much, anyway.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.570
What are you, a cat burglar?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:11.280
Th-th-th-th-th-th-that's off limits!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.490
Stop!!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:16.120
Anyway, I've got nothing to do, so I'm bored.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:20.250
If you're bored, how about doing my homework?

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.340
Sorry! I'm not <i>that</i> bored.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.760
Ah, bu-, yo-, uh...

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:27.880
Ahh!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.850
Nnnnnghh!!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.060
A game console, huh?

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:37.560
Hey, Kyon.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:39.480
I wanna play this.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:40.060
Hook it up?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.110
Now, look here.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.110
Just what do you think we
all came here to do today?

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:46.940
Homework, right?
'Kay, hook it up.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.320
And, that should do it.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.490
What input do I put it on?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.830
Video 3.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.080
So, what's your pleasure?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.330
What have you got?

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:01.080
Uh... An RPG, a puzzle game, a fighting game...

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.710
Ohh, the fighting game!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:07.760
I like it when there's no long intros or rules,
and you can just solve everything with violence!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.690
You shouldn't be saying things like that!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.340
Now just select that,
choose your character...

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:19.600
Hoh, hoh.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.230
And I guess I'll be player 2–

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.820
What about your homework!?

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.860
I-I couldn't help it!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.860
She wanted to play, so I had to!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:31.570
You sure can talk, considering
how carried away you were getting.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.320
I just thought it'd be a nice change of pace.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:38.450
A change from what pace?
You haven't even started!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.120
Nagato-san, please fill in
as Suzumiya-san's opponent.

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:46.250
You've been staring wide-eyed at that
game ever since they brought it out.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.380
Alright, Yuki, you're in.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.260
Objection!

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.010
Nagato's with me in the
"hasn't done her homework" camp!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.060
Kyon-kun, you just don't get it, do you?

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:57.850
Don't get what?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.480
Why I, the Demon Teacher herself,

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:04.020
have not said a word to Nagato-san,
despite the fact that she still has homework left.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.020
Huh?

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.020
Now that you mention it, that's true...

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.780
This girl can actually do it.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.240
In a single night.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.240
Without even having to rush herself.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.910
They call her:

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.830
"One-Night Yuki"

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:25.920
She can get things done
when it counts, huh?

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:30.460
Just look at her!
You can <i>see</i> the aura coming from her!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.260
Ah! I can't open my eyes!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.510
It's too bright!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.720
B-but I'm not even glowing!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.890
What'll it be, Kyon-kun?

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:41.100
There may be no tomorrow for you.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.730
Asakura-sensei, I'm sorry!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.610
I was in the wrong!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.400
I'm glad you understand.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.990
Sensei! Year 3, Class B, Asabashi-sensei!!

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.360
What was that!?

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.910
Come on, can we get started already?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.210
Suzumiya Haruhi

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.210
Nagato Yuki

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.380
Haruhi's all over the damn place.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.970
And yet, it's surprisingly...

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.810
I-I can't read her movements.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.600
Even though she's just a beginner...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.730
She keeps managing to pull off
moves at just the right moments.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.980
Yeah!!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.280
I think I might just have
a knack for fighting games!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.990
O-... one more round.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.330
Just what I was thinking!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.960
I win again!

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.580
One more.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.750
Bring it on!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.930
I win I win I win again!

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.010
I'm done for...

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.720
Hold on, hold on!

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.600
You two are getting too riled up.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.180
Keep it down a bit.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:09.020
Well, I guess I needed a break anyway.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.440
All right! Time for a break!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:14.530
Kyon-kun, you still haven't
even made any progress!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.700
Not my fault, the game
was distracting me.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.200
Kyon-kun, open up!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.740
These are for you.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:24.660
Ohh, <i>nice timing</i>!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.750
Well done. Alright, let's have that break!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.330
Oh, fine.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.180
Hmm?

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.640
Where did you go?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:45.770
Just to borrow your restroom for a bit.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.850
Did you find it okay?

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.560
Yes. Your mother gave me directions.

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.060
M-m-m-my mom?

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.860
Hurray!!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.950
She absolutely tore me to pieces.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.870
A battle between beginners
is unreadable either way...

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:09.620
Next, how about a change of pace
that we can all participate in?

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.000
I like that!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.090
Oh, playing cards! Haven't seen
those since the hot springs trip.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:14.710
I'm in!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:18.630
Jeez. Koizumi-kun, you're not done
with your homework either, are you?

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.840
Ah, I appreciate your concern, but,

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.970
I <i>finished</i> just earlier.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:28.430
Huh? Koizumi, you went
ahead and abandoned me!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.810
No, our starting lines were completely different in the first place, after all.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:35.610
Dammit! And that's why you had time to
carelessly wander off to the bathroom?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.860
Sorry to trouble you.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:41.110
Asakura! I need that change
of pace now more than ever!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.370
If you insist. But just for a bit.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:49.290
Alright. Koizumi-kun,
hurry up and deal those cards.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.290
What game shall we play?

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.880
Old Maid! I wanna play Old Maid!

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.210
Sounds good to me.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.380
Homework takes enough brain power on its own, so I'd rather not use any more on cards.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.590
If I do, I think my head might overheat.

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:03.050
Old Maid!

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:03.680
I see.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.510
Okay, Rich Man Poor Man it is!

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.640
What happened to Old Maid!?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.310
Yay, Rich Man Poor Man!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.140
Understood.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.980
Everyone, let me just
say it one more time:

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.480
This is only just for a bit.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.440
Don't get too carried away.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.400
Yes, Sensei.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.240
O-... one more hand!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.580
I'm going to win this time!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.000
Ah... I do hope so.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:40.120
Hey! Isn't there some way you can deal
to make sure Ryōko is the Rich Man?

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:43.320
I'm sorry, but I don't think that's within my ability.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.850
I guess not.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:47.420
Kyon! You do something!

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:51.040
I'm stuck in the Poor Man loop just like Asakura!

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.520
The one you should be talking to is
the Rich Man of every round so far...

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.830
Nagato!

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.110
W-what?

00:20:57.110 --> 00:21:02.860
I'm begging you! Find some way to make Asakura
the Rich Man, and put an end to this endless game!

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:06.380
Huh? But... how do I do that?

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:09.910
Well, for now let's just say,

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:13.550
this round, if any oblivious idiot
ends up as the Rich Man instead of her,

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.000
they'll have to do a punishment game.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.410
Hurray!!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.730
I'm the Rich Man!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.660
Um...

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:47.930
Oh, that's right. Yesterday, we...

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:57.680
Koizumi said he "<i>finish</i>"ed, right?

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:00.900
And Nagato was on the
"last-minute cramming" team all along...

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:02.710
I...

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:03.250
I'm the only one who isn't done!

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:06.690
I'm the only one who isn't done!

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:17.270
Hel–

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:20.180
Nagato? It's me!
I'm coming over there now!

00:22:20.180 --> 00:22:20.900
Huh?

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:23.050
I need you to help me–...

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:25.790
No, let me copy your
homework! I'm begging you!

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:30.410
Yeah, okay.

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:33.160
I actually just finished.

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.090
Yeah.

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.910
Okay, I'll be waiting for you.
